{"content":"{\"chapter_contract_id\":\"contract:v2-n-8-3:v2\",\"node_id\":\"v2_n_8_3\",\"schema_version\":\"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\"known_evidence_ids\":[],\"blocks\":[{\"block_id\":\"followup:para:intro\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"本节描述本项目失访判定所依据的项目特定联系尝试、记录、复核分类与责任要求。失访判定应基于项目特定联系尝试、记录与复核分类；单次漏访不足以判定失访。失访、未联系上与撤回知情同意应分别判定，未联系上不等于撤回知情同意。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"block_id\":\"followup:block:table\",\"kind\":\"table\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"table\":{\"table_id\":\"followup:table:contact_review_classification\",\"block_id\":\"followup:block:table\",\"title\":\"失访联系、记录、复核分类与责任表\",\"columns\":[{\"column_id\":\"followup:col:item\",\"order\":0,\"label\":\"环节\",\"semantic_role\":\"item\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"style_role\":\"header\"},{\"column_id\":\"followup:col:requirement\",\"order\":1,\"label\":\"项目特定要求\",\"semantic_role\":\"requirement\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"style_role\":\"body\"},{\"column_id\":\"followup:col:documentation\",\"order\":2,\"label\":\"记录与责任\",\"semantic_role\":\"documentation\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"style_role\":\"body\"}],\"header_row_count\":1,\"rows\":[{\"row_id\":\"followup:row:header\",\"order\":0,\"label\":\"\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:header:item\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:header\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:item\",\"text\":\"环节\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:header:requirement\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:header\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:requirement\",\"text\":\"项目特定要求\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:header:documentation\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:header\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:documentation\",\"text\":\"记录与责任\",\"style_role\":\"header\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"followup:row:contact_attempt_procedure\",\"order\":1,\"label\":\"\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:contact_attempt_procedure:item\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:contact_attempt_procedure\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:item\",\"text\":\"联系尝试程序\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:contact_attempt_procedure:requirement\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:contact_attempt_procedure\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:requirement\",\"text\":\"在第24周访视窗口及随访到期后，通过电话、短信或邮件、信件等经批准的联系方式至少进行3次联系尝试，尽量覆盖不同日期和时段；可联系受试者提供的紧急联系人，但需符合知情同意和隐私要求。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:contact_attempt_procedure:documentation\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:contact_attempt_procedure\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:documentation\",\"text\":\"由研究中心按项目程序执行；联系方式需经批准并符合知情同意和隐私要求。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"followup:row:participant_contact_restrictions\",\"order\":2,\"label\":\"\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:participant_contact_restrictions:item\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:participant_contact_restrictions\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:item\",\"text\":\"联系限制\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:participant_contact_restrictions:requirement\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:participant_contact_restrictions\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:requirement\",\"text\":\"联系不得侵犯隐私，不得向无关人员披露研究信息；仅使用受试者授权联系方式；受试者撤回知情同意或要求停止联系后，不再进行失访联系。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:participant_contact_restrictions:documentation\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:participant_contact_restrictions\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:documentation\",\"text\":\"遵循受试者授权、隐私要求和知情同意；撤回同意或要求停止联系后不再进行失访联系。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"followup:row:attempt_records\",\"order\":3,\"label\":\"\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:attempt_records:item\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:attempt_records\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:item\",\"text\":\"联系尝试记录\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:contact_attempt_log\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:attempt_records\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:requirement\",\"text\":\"每次联系尝试均记录日期、时间、方式、联系对象、结果和操作者；记录保存在受试者源文件和eCRF或随访记录中。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:attempt_records:documentation\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:attempt_records\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:documentation\",\"text\":\"记录责任方：操作者；记录保存于受试者源文件和eCRF或随访记录。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"followup:row:review_and_classification\",\"order\":4,\"label\":\"\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:review_and_classification:item\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:review_and_classification\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:item\",\"text\":\"复核与分类\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:review_and_classification:requirement\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:review_and_classification\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:requirement\",\"text\":\"由研究者或指定人员审核联系记录，确认已按程序完成合理尝试后，将受试者分类为失访；分类日期、依据和末次接触日期记录在eCRF。若后续恢复联系，按方案评估是否继续随访。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:review_and_classification:documentation\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:review_and_classification\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:documentation\",\"text\":\"分类日期、依据和末次接触日期记录在eCRF；恢复联系后按方案评估是否继续随访。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"followup:row:role_and_approvals\",\"order\":5,\"label\":\"\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:role_and_approvals:item\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:role_and_approvals\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:item\",\"text\":\"责任与批准\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:role_and_approvals:requirement\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:role_and_approvals\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:requirement\",\"text\":\"研究中心研究者负责联系、记录和初步分类；医学监查员或申办者审核失访分类及对分析的影响；必要时与伦理委员会沟通。所有分类和审批记录保存。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:role_and_approvals:documentation\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:role_and_approvals\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:documentation\",\"text\":\"所有分类和审批记录保存。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"followup:row:consent_and_outcome_distinction\",\"order\":6,\"label\":\"\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:consent_and_outcome_distinction:item\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:consent_and_outcome_distinction\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:item\",\"text\":\"判定区别\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:consent_and_outcome_distinction:requirement\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:consent_and_outcome_distinction\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:requirement\",\"text\":\"失访不同于撤回知情同意：撤回知情同意是受试者明确决定退出，之后不再联系；失访是经多次合理尝试仍无法联系，且无明确撤回同意。若无法联系但已知死亡或转归，应记录为相应结局而非失访。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:consent_and_outcome_distinction:documentation\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:consent_and_outcome_distinction\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:documentation\",\"text\":\"失访、撤回同意与未联系上分别判定；未联系上不等于撤回知情同意。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"followup:row:missed_visit_not_ltfu\",\"order\":7,\"label\":\"\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:missed_visit_not_ltfu:item\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:missed_visit_not_ltfu\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:item\",\"text\":\"漏访与失访\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:missed_visit_not_ltfu:requirement\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:missed_visit_not_ltfu\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:requirement\",\"text\":\"单次漏访不足以判定失访；失访判定必须基于项目特定联系尝试、记录与复核分类。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"followup:cell:missed_visit_not_ltfu:documentation\",\"row_id\":\"followup:row:missed_visit_not_ltfu\",\"column_id\":\"followup:col:documentation\",\"text\":\"不得将单次漏访或未联系上直接分类为失访。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]}],\"notes\":[],\"role\":\"body_content\",\"domain\":\"generic\",\"review_state\":\"ai_draft\",\"schema_version\":\"structured_table_v1\",\"version\":0,\"source_locator\":\"\",\"word_layout\":{}}},{\"block_id\":\"followup:para:closing\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"失访不同于撤回知情同意：撤回知情同意是受试者明确决定退出，之后不再联系；失访是经多次合理尝试仍无法联系，且无明确撤回同意。若无法联系但已知死亡或转归，应记录为相应结局而非失访。若后续恢复联系，按方案评估是否继续随访。所有分类和审批记录保存。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"614719026844db2a4c809c3638301b16e1d359a90f34fcfbbda85d350dc58204"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:4f49abbbfe71cfd1c68bd022a09ef83cbecafd080fab4eb5886af969e636c4ef:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:4f49abbbfe71cfd1c68bd022a09ef83cbecafd080fab4eb5886af969e636c4ef:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"6949aacc4553a1dea25f50755f3552819f3350e431a4bc9c0d0f652076930644","prompt_s